<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia announces 5.28 trillion peso bond issue.</title>
<headline>Colombia announces 5.28 trillion peso bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombian government said Thursday it would issue 5.28 trillion pesos in treasury bonds in local markets in 1997.</p>
<p>In an official statement the government said 4.7 trillion pesos would be used to finance the 1997 budget and the remainder would be used to fund short-term treasury operations.</p>
</text>
